degraded.description:
The degraded marker while the session runs below full hardening,
for example `sandbox: partial:landlock_net` (spec:
security-boundaries, Hardening downgrades are never silent).

LocalParams.description:
Params of every `local.*` method; each uses the fields its command
takes (`model` for pull, rm and use; `job` for pause and resume;
`query` for search; `path` for add).
